 "id": "1627087928239307", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031529_1627087931572640_4083118609254979821_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=J5cSHESnXNUQ7kNvwGVprFk&_nc_oc=AdoWTZOP8SeGWSnoL1FZIbOyEHq7fYUsPRrUVwPANSmCqmvdGqXe8Vcx214ezuwzwhw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9GuTf2HtIqfoJ5w5MAxId9NXbe6pTkvQQ6wRGS46ME5A&oe=6A26E680"}, {"file_name": "bowling_escavation.png", "id": "1076453430688828", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974746_1076453434022161_3902000793864200888_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1ENyjlWFHWwQ7kNvwGJBxE8&_nc_oc=AdrFNt3AgD7KNzbdhLKo7txiJqq5HmZoiKMd6-fy2wF3HYK9BUKNdVX4wQR6qY0chAA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9OBo4SgRCmkbn7r3iQNziWF-2w6ceVB7M7ZSQEZ_LINg&oe=6A26B80F"}, {"file_name": "asteroid_scanning.png", "id": "1708518839722580", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75303839_1708518843055913_8867692545714880265_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=e8mrq26m_TUQ7kNvwGaSe2i&_nc_oc=Adq2js_ChWWVKiSHtbB7HbmVEb7sspIT1cDBZ_nSzQVh_OifIzrQnzJGOPkF8F1rRdQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_s-50BXy28VqPStAJZ3UU_BS1_99Ja5hmfqN-dgFYrRw&oe=6A26BC0D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_ASP_CoverImage.png", "id": "865693635411839", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031309_865693638745172_2747540183598569721_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RreJnBTSObUQ7kNvwFGfjCa&_nc_oc=AdqJzWGkZg7LnuSWdjATCDOYY_uobKNyZp1stXh_-nRoFxbT-bhF6Hgm4TlZUaqsNG0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-6bdF8dK93oxMYVCe1PYCGbOH3NNFVP9_RUtqMNrS8iw&oe=6A26DECD"}, "display_name": "A Space Pawdyssey", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# Embark on A Space Pawdyssey!\n\nYou play **Astra**, a smart, sweet and ambitious husky, sent on a space exploration mission by the human-led organization called PAWSA.\n\nAstra is joined by a quirky team of companions **SBURD**, a deranged goose that only communicates through honks and unsettling stares; **Albert the XV**, a cynical and well-educated monkey, that is also the team\u2019s weapon expert; and **Luna**, an adorable, but slightly neurotic mouse suffering from space allergies and a massive crush on the goose.\n{949438840336802}\n\n\n The team is tasked with traveling to two mysterious planets to collect three vital ingredients for analysis, providing insights into newly discovered celestial bodies. \n{606909931764369}\n\n\nAlong the way, they face a series of **wild adventures** and **chaotic disasters**: \n{413392028505368}\n\nLuna gets launched across the first planet by an uncontrollable sneezing fit, a **meteor shower** pummels the second planet, and a **space battle** erupts with French cat astronauts. \n\nFrom **reactor reboots** to electrical malfunctions and the unclogging of the ship\u2019s engines after a vicious **chicken \"bowel movement\" attack**, this crew has to master it all.\n\n{549656377922356}\nThese adrenaline-packed challenges are paired with fun **puzzle** and **rhythm-based** mini-games, which serve as the key to experimenting with the collected ingredients.\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "Join the space pack and embark on a high-stakes cosmic adventure: Battle meteor storms, rival feline-astronauts, and chaotic mishaps like sneezing fits and questionable chicken sabotage. Solve puzzles, play rhythm mini-games, and explore newly discovered planets!!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://anotherworldvr.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "anotherworld GmbH", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://anotherworldvr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAME